{"publicId":"ffd77858-a9c2-44f5-ab5e-ec347e89a757","title":"Bitcoin Core披露两个安全漏洞并完成修复，新报道称数量增至三个","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T16:30:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T16:30:00.000Z","digest":"Bitcoin Core于2026年11月披露两个安全漏洞（CVE-2025-62859和CVE-2025-62861），并完成修复，需升级至30.0或更高版本以避免风险。\nCVE-2025-62859（中危）由Eugene Siegel发现，影响29.2及之前版本，修复于29.2和30.0，可能导致节点区块处理停滞；CVE-2025-62861（高危）由Niklas Goegge发现，影响28.0至29.1版本，修复回溯至旧分支，可能导致节点重启前无法出块。\n新报道（2026-11-12）称Bitcoin Core披露三个漏洞，但未明确第三个漏洞的细节及发现者，与早先报道存在数量差异，需进一步确认。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T19:02:39.858Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Bitcoin Core 披露可能冻结挖矿节点的安全漏洞","latestReport":{"id":"xq7e6hd46ukhe0wdzm4yjh6nz"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":2,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":3,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fVXXexLlIbNY","title":"Bitcoin Core Discloses Bugs That Could Freeze Mining Nodes","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T16:30:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"xq7e6hd46ukhe0wdzm4yjh6nz","title":"Bitcoin Core 披露可能冻结挖矿节点的安全漏洞","summary":"Bitcoin Core 于 2025 年 11 月 10 日披露了三个安全漏洞，其中一个是高危漏洞，两个是中危漏洞。所有修复已包含在 2025 年 10 月 10 日发布的 30.0 版本中，以及 29.2 版本中。这些漏洞可能导致挖矿节点无法生成区块。","source":{"name":"Unchained","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T16:30:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"xq7e6hd46ukhe0wdzm4yjh6nz","title":"Bitcoin Core 披露可能冻结挖矿节点的安全漏洞","summary":"Bitcoin Core 于 2025 年 11 月 10 日披露了三个安全漏洞，其中一个是高危漏洞，两个是中危漏洞。所有修复已包含在 2025 年 10 月 10 日发布的 30.0 版本中，以及 29.2 版本中。这些漏洞可能导致挖矿节点无法生成区块。","source":{"name":"Unchained","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T16:30:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":9.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T04:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T07:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"